---
manual: styles.left
lines: [1288, 1294]
testability: visual
display: native
ledger: C15
expect: fail
reason: "the native layout still reads a negative left or top as that far in from the slot's far edge (DESIGN 6's dimension rule), where art takes it as a plain coordinate (C15)."
----------- app code
Shoes.app width: 300, height: 200 do
  nostroke
  @drifting = oval -30, 50, 100, fill: red
end
----------- test code
assert_equal(-30, layout_of(oval("@drifting")).x.round, "the oval's box starts 30 px left of the window")
assert_equal [255, 0, 0], pixel_at(10, 100).first(3), "so its right half shows at the left edge"
assert_equal [255, 255, 255], pixel_at(290, 100).first(3), "and nothing jumps to the far edge"
